        "runId": "ada-en-20261109-a769ac8379f2d25c8c252a41",
        "model": "GPT-6"
      },
      "text": "Arrive in Ecuador's capital.\n\nYou'll be met at the airport and taken to your hotel.\n\nThe transfer takes about 1 hour.\n\nDinner with your guide is included this evening.\n\nYou'll have a chance to discuss the itinerary and ask questions about the days ahead.\n\nYou'll stay at Finlandia 4*.\n\nDinner is included."
